; A price looked up before `alias Real` must be looked up again after
; it: the alias joins Real's prices to BRL, so the lookup that found no
; INR -> BRL price before the alias finds one after it.

commodity BRL

P 2024/01/01 INR 2.00 Real
P 2024/01/05 XYZ (market(1 INR, [2024/01/10], "BRL"))

commodity BRL
    alias Real

P 2024/01/06 QQQ (market(1 INR, [2024/01/10], "BRL"))
